{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9DaGluZXNlLU1vdmllcy9BbGwlMjBZb3UlMjBOZWVkJTIwSXMlMjBMb3ZlJTIwJTI4MjAxNSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"All You Need Is Love","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/6xEOwuCsxkjawHbZQMNFO9q8Ro1.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eO11O79TDCUeVv7ujmHe8av1eik.jpg","description":"Tired of her family constantly nagging her to get married, spoiled heiress Yeh Fenfen (Shu Qi) books a stay at a beautiful villa on the Penghu Islands, which are the subject of a classic song on a tape left for her by her mother. When she arrives at her destination, she's dismayed to find that the gorgeous villa is actually a rundown B&B owned by Wu (Richie Jen). It turns out that Wu's friends, hoping to drum up some business for the B&B, falsified a few details about the state of the property on the internet. Angered by the deception, Fenfen packs her bags and leaves the next day. But, when she loses all of her luggage on the boat ride, Fenfen has no choice but to head back to the island.","releaseInfo":"2015","genres":["Romance","Comedy","Others"],"imdbRating":"6.2","runtime":"103 min","cast":["Shu Qi","Richie Jen","Lego Lee","Ma Nien-Hsien","Ti Lung","Lotus Wang","Vivian Dawson","Bowie Tsang"],"director":["Andy Luo","Richie Jen"],"released":"2015-09-03T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Shu Qi","character":"Yeh Fenfen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ycuwRV9fEKieAAZN81rC3xcuxaE.jpg"},{"name":"Richie Jen","character":"Wu","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/A4oidg4FY6or9TNHi2yz1TO7xeH.jpg"},{"name":"Lego Lee","character":"Wu Si-fu","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fLc3PiRJldvAIZa4wpxgxJRpUMP.jpg"},{"name":"Ma Nien-Hsien","character":"MacGyver","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5u7wYt5aF44ETlCO9zWDSXe4Mui.jpg"},{"name":"Ti Lung","character":"Mr. Wu","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dxA5qEE0c6kKxoRJXttAwSooMSv.jpg"},{"name":"Lotus Wang","charact